		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>E『来るぞ……
母なる　マザーシップが……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
