	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event4_enemy_7"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>E『……　……ねむったか▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]……　おまえは……
この　せかいで　さいごの▽
ただひとりの　にんげんと　なる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>E『……　……眠ったか▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]……　お前は……
この星で　最期の▽
ただひとりの　人間と　なる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
